license: GPL-2.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/maRce10/mobbing_ontogeny
url: https://marce10.github.io/mobbing_ontogeny/
abstract: >-
  Data and Bayesian analyses of a playback experiment testing whether
  passerine birds at Las Cruces Biological Station, Costa Rica, mob
  vocalizations of a sympatric pygmy-owl (Glaucidium costaricanum) more than
  those of two allopatric congeners (G. brasilianum and G. passerinum).
keywords:
  - mobbing
  - antipredator behavior
  - predator recognition
  - playback experiment
  - Glaucidium
  - tropical birds
